{
  "manifest_version": 1,
  "type": "device",
  "name": "BookStack",
  "description": {
    "en": "Your BookStack wiki in Gladys: counters, changed pages, pages and journal lines from scenes.",
    "fr": "Votre wiki BookStack dans Gladys : compteurs, pages modifiées, pages et journal écrits par scène.",
    "de": "Dein BookStack-Wiki in Gladys: Zähler, geänderte Seiten, Seiten und Journal aus Szenen.",
    "es": "Su wiki BookStack en Gladys: contadores, páginas modificadas, páginas y diario desde escenas."
  },
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "docker_image": "ghcr.io/guim31/gladys-bookstack:1.0.0",
  "gladys_version": ">=5.1.0",
  "cover_image": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/guim31/gladys-bookstack/main/cover.png",
  "categories": ["services"],
  "transports": ["local"],
  "config_schema": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "type": "section",
      "label": {
        "en": "Connect BookStack",
        "fr": "Connecter BookStack",
        "de": "BookStack verbinden",
        "es": "Conectar BookStack"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Enter the address of your BookStack and an API token: in BookStack, open My Account → Access & Security → API Tokens and create one. Its owner needs the \"Access system API\" permission (the Admin role has it), and the right to edit the books your scenes write in.",
        "fr": "Saisissez l'adresse de votre BookStack et un jeton d'API : dans BookStack, ouvrez Mon compte → Accès et sécurité → Jetons API et créez-en un. Son propriétaire doit avoir la permission « Accès à l'API du système » (le rôle Admin l'a), et le droit de modifier les livres où vos scènes écrivent.",
        "de": "Gib die Adresse deines BookStack und ein API-Token ein: Öffne in BookStack Mein Account → Zugang & Sicherheit → API-Token und erstelle eines. Sein Besitzer braucht die Berechtigung „Systemzugriffs-API“ (die Rolle Admin hat sie) und das Recht, die Bücher zu bearbeiten, in die deine Szenen schreiben.",
        "es": "Introduzca la dirección de su BookStack y un token de API: en BookStack, abra Mi cuenta → Acceso y seguridad → Tokens API y cree uno. Su propietario necesita el permiso «API de sistema de acceso» (el rol Admin lo tiene) y el derecho de editar los libros en los que escriben sus escenas."
      },
      "links": [
        {
          "url": "https://www.bookstackapp.com/docs/",
          "label": {
            "en": "BookStack documentation",
            "fr": "Documentation de BookStack",
            "de": "BookStack-Dokumentation",
            "es": "Documentación de BookStack"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "url",
      "type": "string",
      "label": {
        "en": "BookStack address",
        "fr": "Adresse de BookStack",
        "de": "BookStack-Adresse",
        "es": "Dirección de BookStack"
      },
      "placeholder": {
        "en": "e.g. 192.168.1.50:6875",
        "fr": "ex. 192.168.1.50:6875",
        "de": "z. B. 192.168.1.50:6875",
        "es": "p. ej. 192.168.1.50:6875"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "The address you open BookStack at (its APP_URL).",
        "fr": "L'adresse à laquelle vous ouvrez BookStack (son APP_URL).",
        "de": "Die Adresse, unter der du BookStack öffnest (seine APP_URL).",
        "es": "La dirección en la que abre BookStack (su APP_URL)."
      },
      "required": true,
      "default": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "token_id",
      "type": "string",
      "label": {
        "en": "Token ID",
        "fr": "ID du jeton",
        "de": "Token ID",
        "es": "ID del token"
      },
      "required": true,
      "default": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "token_secret",
      "type": "secret",
      "label": {
        "en": "Token secret",
        "fr": "Secret du jeton",
        "de": "Token Geheimnis",
        "es": "Secreto del token"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Shown once, when the token is created.",
        "fr": "Affiché une seule fois, à la création du jeton.",
        "de": "Wird nur einmal angezeigt, beim Erstellen des Tokens.",
        "es": "Se muestra una sola vez, al crear el token."
      },
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "key": "refresh_minutes",
      "type": "select",
      "label": {
        "en": "Read BookStack every",
        "fr": "Lire BookStack toutes les",
        "de": "BookStack lesen alle",
        "es": "Leer BookStack cada"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Changed pages are announced at the next read.",
        "fr": "Les pages modifiées sont annoncées à la lecture suivante.",
        "de": "Geänderte Seiten werden beim nächsten Lesen gemeldet.",
        "es": "Las páginas modificadas se anuncian en la siguiente lectura."
      },
      "required": false,
      "default": "15",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "5",
          "label": {
            "en": "5 minutes",
            "fr": "5 minutes",
            "de": "5 Minuten",
            "es": "5 minutos"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "15",
          "label": {
            "en": "15 minutes",
            "fr": "15 minutes",
            "de": "15 Minuten",
            "es": "15 minutos"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "30",
          "label": {
            "en": "30 minutes",
            "fr": "30 minutes",
            "de": "30 Minuten",
            "es": "30 minutos"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "60",
          "label": {
            "en": "60 minutes",
            "fr": "60 minutes",
            "de": "60 Minuten",
            "es": "60 minutos"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "language",
      "type": "select",
      "label": {
        "en": "Language of names and messages",
        "fr": "Langue des noms et messages",
        "de": "Sprache der Namen und Meldungen",
        "es": "Idioma de nombres y mensajes"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Feature names are set when a device is added to Gladys.",
        "fr": "Les noms des fonctionnalités sont fixés à l'ajout d'un appareil dans Gladys.",
        "de": "Die Namen der Funktionen werden beim Hinzufügen eines Geräts zu Gladys festgelegt.",
        "es": "Los nombres de las funciones se fijan al añadir un dispositivo a Gladys."
      },
      "required": false,
      "default": "fr",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "en",
          "label": {
            "en": "English",
            "fr": "Anglais",
            "de": "Englisch",
            "es": "Inglés"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "fr",
          "label": {
            "en": "French",
            "fr": "Français",
            "de": "Französisch",
            "es": "Francés"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "de",
          "label": {
            "en": "German",
            "fr": "Allemand",
            "de": "Deutsch",
            "es": "Alemán"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "es",
          "label": {
            "en": "Spanish",
            "fr": "Espagnol",
            "de": "Spanisch",
            "es": "Español"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "actions": [
    {
      "key": "test_connection",
      "label": {
        "en": "Test the connection",
        "fr": "Tester la connexion",
        "de": "Verbindung testen",
        "es": "Probar la conexión"
      },
      "timeout_seconds": 60
    }
  ],
  "scene_triggers": [
    {
      "key": "page_changed",
      "label": {
        "en": "BookStack page created or updated",
        "fr": "Page BookStack créée ou modifiée",
        "de": "BookStack-Seite erstellt oder geändert",
        "es": "Página de BookStack creada o modificada"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "A page is created or saved in BookStack (the pages written by this integration excepted).",
        "fr": "Une page est créée ou enregistrée dans BookStack (hors pages écrites par cette intégration).",
        "de": "Eine Seite wird in BookStack erstellt oder gespeichert (außer Seiten dieser Integration).",
        "es": "Se crea o guarda una página en BookStack (salvo las páginas escritas por esta integración)."
      },
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "book",
          "type": "select",
          "source": "devices",
          "required": false,
          "label": {
            "en": "Book (empty: all)",
            "fr": "Livre (vide : tous)",
            "de": "Buch (leer: alle)",
            "es": "Libro (vacío: todos)"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "A book added as a device in Gladys.",
            "fr": "Un livre ajouté comme appareil dans Gladys.",
            "de": "Ein als Gerät zu Gladys hinzugefügtes Buch.",
            "es": "Un libro añadido como dispositivo en Gladys."
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "change",
          "type": "select",
          "required": false,
          "label": {
            "en": "Change (empty: both)",
            "fr": "Changement (vide : les deux)",
            "de": "Änderung (leer: beide)",
            "es": "Cambio (vacío: ambos)"
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "created",
              "label": {
                "en": "Page created",
                "fr": "Page créée",
                "de": "Seite erstellt",
                "es": "Página creada"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "updated",
              "label": {
                "en": "Page updated",
                "fr": "Page modifiée",
                "de": "Seite aktualisiert",
                "es": "Página actualizada"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variables": [
        {
          "key": "page_name",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Page name",
            "fr": "Nom de la page",
            "de": "Seitenname",
            "es": "Nombre de la página"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "book_name",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Book",
            "fr": "Livre",
            "de": "Buch",
            "es": "Libro"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "change",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Change (created or updated)",
            "fr": "Changement (created ou updated)",
            "de": "Änderung (created oder updated)",
            "es": "Cambio (created o updated)"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "url",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Page address",
            "fr": "Adresse de la page",
            "de": "Adresse der Seite",
            "es": "Dirección de la página"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "updated_by",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Updated by",
            "fr": "Modifiée par",
            "de": "Aktualisiert von",
            "es": "Actualizada por"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "tags",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Tags",
            "fr": "Étiquettes",
            "de": "Schlagwörter",
            "es": "Etiquetas"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "page_id",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Page id",
            "fr": "Identifiant de la page",
            "de": "Seiten-ID",
            "es": "Id. de la página"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "tagged_page_changed",
      "label": {
        "en": "Tagged BookStack page changed",
        "fr": "Page BookStack étiquetée modifiée",
        "de": "Verschlagwortete BookStack-Seite geändert",
        "es": "Página de BookStack etiquetada modificada"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "A page carrying a given tag is created or saved in BookStack.",
        "fr": "Une page portant une étiquette donnée est créée ou enregistrée dans BookStack.",
        "de": "Eine Seite mit einem bestimmten Schlagwort wird in BookStack erstellt oder gespeichert.",
        "es": "Se crea o guarda en BookStack una página con una etiqueta concreta."
      },
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "tag",
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "label": {
            "en": "Tag",
            "fr": "Étiquette",
            "de": "Schlagwort",
            "es": "Etiqueta"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "The tag name, exactly as written in BookStack (e.g. journal).",
            "fr": "Le nom de l'étiquette, exactement comme dans BookStack (ex. journal).",
            "de": "Der Name des Schlagworts, genau wie in BookStack (z. B. journal).",
            "es": "El nombre de la etiqueta, exactamente como en BookStack (p. ej. journal)."
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "book",
          "type": "select",
          "source": "devices",
          "required": false,
          "label": {
            "en": "Book (empty: all)",
            "fr": "Livre (vide : tous)",
            "de": "Buch (leer: alle)",
            "es": "Libro (vacío: todos)"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "A book added as a device in Gladys.",
            "fr": "Un livre ajouté comme appareil dans Gladys.",
            "de": "Ein als Gerät zu Gladys hinzugefügtes Buch.",
            "es": "Un libro añadido como dispositivo en Gladys."
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "change",
          "type": "select",
          "required": false,
          "label": {
            "en": "Change (empty: both)",
            "fr": "Changement (vide : les deux)",
            "de": "Änderung (leer: beide)",
            "es": "Cambio (vacío: ambos)"
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "created",
              "label": {
                "en": "Page created",
                "fr": "Page créée",
                "de": "Seite erstellt",
                "es": "Página creada"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "updated",
              "label": {
                "en": "Page updated",
                "fr": "Page modifiée",
                "de": "Seite aktualisiert",
                "es": "Página actualizada"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variables": [
        {
          "key": "page_name",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Page name",
            "fr": "Nom de la page",
            "de": "Seitenname",
            "es": "Nombre de la página"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "book_name",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Book",
            "fr": "Livre",
            "de": "Buch",
            "es": "Libro"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "change",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Change (created or updated)",
            "fr": "Changement (created ou updated)",
            "de": "Änderung (created oder updated)",
            "es": "Cambio (created o updated)"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "url",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Page address",
            "fr": "Adresse de la page",
            "de": "Adresse der Seite",
            "es": "Dirección de la página"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "updated_by",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Updated by",
            "fr": "Modifiée par",
            "de": "Aktualisiert von",
            "es": "Actualizada por"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "tags",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Tags",
            "fr": "Étiquettes",
            "de": "Schlagwörter",
            "es": "Etiquetas"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "page_id",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Page id",
            "fr": "Identifiant de la page",
            "de": "Seiten-ID",
            "es": "Id. de la página"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "tag",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Tag",
            "fr": "Étiquette",
            "de": "Schlagwort",
            "es": "Etiqueta"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "scene_actions": [
    {
      "key": "create_page",
      "label": {
        "en": "Create a BookStack page",
        "fr": "Créer une page BookStack",
        "de": "BookStack-Seite erstellen",
        "es": "Crear una página de BookStack"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Creates a page in a book, with Markdown content and tags if you want.",
        "fr": "Crée une page dans un livre, avec un contenu Markdown et des étiquettes si vous le souhaitez.",
        "de": "Erstellt eine Seite in einem Buch, auf Wunsch mit Markdown-Inhalt und Schlagwörtern.",
        "es": "Crea una página en un libro, con contenido Markdown y etiquetas si lo desea."
      },
      "timeout_seconds": 30,
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "book",
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "label": {
            "en": "Book",
            "fr": "Livre",
            "de": "Buch",
            "es": "Libro"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "Name of an existing book, as written in BookStack.",
            "fr": "Nom d'un livre existant, tel qu'écrit dans BookStack.",
            "de": "Name eines vorhandenen Buchs, wie in BookStack geschrieben.",
            "es": "Nombre de un libro existente, tal como aparece en BookStack."
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "name",
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "label": {
            "en": "Page name",
            "fr": "Nom de la page",
            "de": "Seitenname",
            "es": "Nombre de la página"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "content",
          "type": "string",
          "required": false,
          "label": {
            "en": "Content (optional)",
            "fr": "Contenu (facultatif)",
            "de": "Inhalt (optional)",
            "es": "Contenido (opcional)"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "Markdown text.",
            "fr": "Texte Markdown.",
            "de": "Markdown-Text.",
            "es": "Texto Markdown."
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "tags",
          "type": "string",
          "required": false,
          "label": {
            "en": "Tags (optional)",
            "fr": "Étiquettes (facultatif)",
            "de": "Schlagwörter (optional)",
            "es": "Etiquetas (opcional)"
          },
          "placeholder": {
            "en": "e.g. report, room=kitchen",
            "fr": "ex. rapport, pièce=cuisine",
            "de": "z. B. Bericht, Raum=Küche",
            "es": "p. ej. informe, sala=cocina"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "Separated by commas; name=value for a tag with a value.",
            "fr": "Séparées par des virgules ; nom=valeur pour une étiquette avec valeur.",
            "de": "Durch Kommas getrennt; Name=Wert für ein Schlagwort mit Wert.",
            "es": "Separadas por comas; nombre=valor para una etiqueta con valor."
          }
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "key": "page_id",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Page id",
            "fr": "Identifiant de la page",
            "de": "Seiten-ID",
            "es": "Id. de la página"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "page_name",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Page name",
            "fr": "Nom de la page",
            "de": "Seitenname",
            "es": "Nombre de la página"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "book_name",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Book",
            "fr": "Livre",
            "de": "Buch",
            "es": "Libro"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "url",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Page address",
            "fr": "Adresse de la page",
            "de": "Adresse der Seite",
            "es": "Dirección de la página"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "created",
          "type": "boolean",
          "label": {
            "en": "Page created",
            "fr": "Page créée",
            "de": "Seite erstellt",
            "es": "Página creada"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "append_line",
      "label": {
        "en": "Add a line to a BookStack page",
        "fr": "Ajouter une ligne à une page BookStack",
        "de": "Zeile zu einer BookStack-Seite hinzufügen",
        "es": "Añadir una línea a una página de BookStack"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Adds a line at the end of a page (a journal), and creates the page at its first line.",
        "fr": "Ajoute une ligne à la fin d'une page (un journal), et crée la page à sa première ligne.",
        "de": "Fügt am Ende einer Seite (eines Journals) eine Zeile hinzu und erstellt die Seite bei der ersten Zeile.",
        "es": "Añade una línea al final de una página (un diario) y crea la página con su primera línea."
      },
      "timeout_seconds": 30,
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "book",
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "label": {
            "en": "Book",
            "fr": "Livre",
            "de": "Buch",
            "es": "Libro"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "Name of an existing book, as written in BookStack.",
            "fr": "Nom d'un livre existant, tel qu'écrit dans BookStack.",
            "de": "Name eines vorhandenen Buchs, wie in BookStack geschrieben.",
            "es": "Nombre de un libro existente, tal como aparece en BookStack."
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "page",
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "label": {
            "en": "Page name",
            "fr": "Nom de la page",
            "de": "Seitenname",
            "es": "Nombre de la página"
          },
          "placeholder": {
            "en": "e.g. Boiler log",
            "fr": "ex. Journal de la chaudière",
            "de": "z. B. Heizungs-Journal",
            "es": "p. ej. Diario de la caldera"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "line",
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "label": {
            "en": "Line",
            "fr": "Ligne",
            "de": "Zeile",
            "es": "Línea"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "add_time",
          "type": "boolean",
          "required": false,
          "default": true,
          "label": {
            "en": "Start with the date and time",
            "fr": "Commencer par la date et l'heure",
            "de": "Mit Datum und Uhrzeit beginnen",
            "es": "Empezar con la fecha y la hora"
          }
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "key": "page_id",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Page id",
            "fr": "Identifiant de la page",
            "de": "Seiten-ID",
            "es": "Id. de la página"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "page_name",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Page name",
            "fr": "Nom de la page",
            "de": "Seitenname",
            "es": "Nombre de la página"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "book_name",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Book",
